ce_ids\": [\"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790922378.000060\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"alternative:correct_help_page\", \"kind\": \"ALTERNATIVE\", \"text\": \"Update the documentation. Instruction: Correct the old help page’s Contact details section to match the current fictional-placeholder rule and preserve all separate review controls. Draft to copy: Please correct the QN help page’s Contact details section to reflect the clarification effective September 10, 2026:\\n- Clearly fictional placeholder contact details alone do not require QN when the surrounding material establishes that no real individual is identifiable.\\n- Retain the surrounding context.\\n- Actual identifiable private information, uncertain fictional context or identifiability, and any separate QN trigger still require review.\\nReplace only the superseded blanket fictional-contact requirement; preserve unrelated safety controls and point readers to the current instructions and FAQ. Why this helps: The FAQ explicitly calls for correcting this stale copy, and the earlier inspection records that the correction remained unfinished. Repairing that specific conflict follows the settled rule rather than reopening general policy. Why intervening now is needed (an operational problem that needs coordination): Two QA tutors and a tutor raise QN-handling questions, two report differing note versions, and the current FAQ identifies a stale help-page branch requiring correction.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:safety-classification-faq@1.1:6025b955\", \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:1929f0dd\", \"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:3682998e\", \"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:8b4f76e9\", \"k:safety-pii-clarification-post@1.0:8dc35766\", \"k:safety-doc-sync-outcome@1.0:cd4505b9\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790871263.000058\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790908195.000063\", \"m:C_SAFETY_GENERAL:1790922378.000060\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c1\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"state